        {
          "id": 2523620543,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Still finding sysdig functionality not in pcapng-sysdig.c.  Last piece is \"writing a SYSCALL record type\", but that doesn't easily correspond to a \"reading a SYSCALL record type\", because the reading of sysdig data is handled with block types.\n\nShouldn't a record type have a registration for its read and write? And sysdig should be able to conform to that?",
